#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:2
msgid "Server Module Plugins"
msgstr "服务器模块插件"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:4
msgid ""
"The multiprocess ``lmcache server`` is composed from transport-neutral "
"server modules. Built-in modules handle lookup, management, transfer, "
"P2P, and optional experimental flows. A server module plugin lets an "
"installed Python package add extra modules at startup without modifying "
"LMCache source."
msgstr "多进程 ``lmcache server`` 由与传输无关的服务器模块组成。内置模块处理查找、管理、传输、P2P 和可选的实验性流程。服务器模块插件允许已安装的 Python 包在启动时添加额外模块，而无需修改 LMCache 源代码。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:9
msgid ""
"This mechanism is explicit opt-in. Installing a package is not enough to "
"change server behavior; the operator must pass ``--server-module``."
msgstr "此机制是显式选择加入的。仅仅安装一个包不足以改变服务器行为；操作员必须传递 ``--server-module``。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:13
msgid "When to use it"
msgstr "何时使用它"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:15
msgid ""
"Use a server module plugin when implementation should live in another "
"package. Examples include vendor-specific implementations, experimental "
"handlers, or site-local observability/control modules that reuse "
"LMCache's shared ``MPCacheServerContext``."
msgstr "当实现应该位于另一个包中时，请使用服务器模块插件。示例包括特定于供应商的实现、实验性处理程序或重用 LMCache 共享的 ``MPCacheServerContext`` 的站点本地可观察性/控制模块。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:20
msgid ""
"For new extension protocols, prefer a transport-specific service when the"
" extension owns a real client protocol. A plugin can register its own "
"generated gRPC service or its own ZMQ service during LMCache server "
"startup, while the same package also returns server modules for status, "
"cleanup, and shared ``MPCacheServerContext`` access."
msgstr "对于新的扩展协议，当扩展拥有真实的客户端协议时，优先选择特定传输的服务。插件可以在 LMCache 服务器启动期间注册其生成的 gRPC 服务或其自己的 ZMQ 服务，同时同一包还返回用于状态、清理和共享 ``MPCacheServerContext`` 访问的服务器模块。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:26
msgid ""
"For small control-plane calls that do not need a first-class service, "
"plugins may use the stable ``SERVER_MODULE_CALL`` envelope. The core wire"
" contract stays fixed across transports:"
msgstr "对于不需要一流服务的小型控制平面调用，插件可以使用稳定的 ``SERVER_MODULE_CALL`` 信封。核心通信协议在不同传输中保持不变："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:30
msgid "``method`` is a namespaced string such as ``\"my_package.echo\"``."
msgstr "``method`` 是一个命名空间字符串，例如 ``\"my_package.echo\"``。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:31
msgid "``payload`` is plugin-owned request bytes."
msgstr "``payload`` 是插件拥有的请求字节。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:32
msgid ""
"the response contains ``success``, plugin-owned response ``payload`` "
"bytes, and a human-readable ``error`` string."
msgstr "响应包含 ``success``、插件拥有的响应 ``payload`` 字节和可读的 ``error`` 字符串。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:35
msgid ""
"This gives out-of-tree packages a lightweight fallback namespace without "
"appending a new ``RequestType`` enum value or generated gRPC method for "
"every plugin feature. If a feature needs a high-throughput or strongly "
"typed API, register a package-owned gRPC/ZMQ service. If every LMCache "
"client should know about the API, add that request type, payload, "
"response, and gRPC schema to LMCache core instead."
msgstr "这为树外包提供了一个轻量级的回退命名空间，无需为每个插件功能附加新的 ``RequestType`` 枚举值或生成的 gRPC 方法。如果某个功能需要高吞吐量或强类型的 API，请注册一个包拥有的 gRPC/ZMQ 服务。如果每个 LMCache 客户端都应该了解该 API，请将该请求类型、有效负载、响应和 gRPC 架构添加到 LMCache 核心中。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:43
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:45
msgid "Pass one JSON object per ``--server-module`` flag:"
msgstr "每个 ``--server-module`` 标志传递一个 JSON 对象："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:58
msgid ""
"``factory_name`` defaults to ``build_server_modules`` and ``config`` "
"defaults to an empty object. The flag can be repeated, and a single flag "
"may contain a JSON list of module specs."
msgstr "``factory_name`` 默认为 ``build_server_modules``，而 ``config`` 默认为一个空对象。该标志可以重复使用，单个标志可以包含一个模块规格的 JSON 列表。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:62
msgid "Server module spec fields"
msgstr "服务器模块规范字段"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:66
msgid "Field"
msgstr "字段"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:67
msgid "Required"
msgstr "必需的"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:68
msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:69
msgid "``module_path``"
msgstr "``module_path``"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:70
msgid "yes"
msgstr "是"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:71
msgid "Dotted Python import path containing the module factory."
msgstr "包含模块工厂的点分 Python 导入路径。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:72
msgid "``factory_name``"
msgstr "``factory_name``"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:73
#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:77
msgid "no"
msgstr "否"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:74
msgid ""
"Callable name inside ``module_path``. Defaults to "
"``build_server_modules``."
msgstr "``module_path`` 中的可调用名称。默认为 ``build_server_modules``。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:76
msgid "``config``"
msgstr "``config``"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:78
msgid "Plugin-specific JSON object passed to the factory."
msgstr "传递给工厂的插件特定 JSON 对象。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:81
msgid "Factory contract"
msgstr "工厂契约"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:83
msgid ""
"The factory receives one ``ExtServerModuleBuildContext`` and returns "
"``ExtServerModuleComponents``. For backwards compatibility, returning one"
" module, a sequence of modules, or ``None`` is also accepted:"
msgstr "工厂接收一个 ``ExtServerModuleBuildContext`` 并返回 ``ExtServerModuleComponents``。为了向后兼容，返回一个模块、一系列模块或 ``None`` 也是可以接受的："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:105
msgid "A service-only package can return no modules:"
msgstr "一个仅服务的包可以不返回模块："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:116
msgid "``ExtServerModuleBuildContext`` contains:"
msgstr "``ExtServerModuleBuildContext`` 包含："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:118
msgid "``server_context``: the shared ``MPCacheServerContext``."
msgstr "``server_context``: 共享的 ``MPCacheServerContext``。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:119
msgid "``mp_config``: parsed ``MPServerConfig``."
msgstr "``mp_config``: 解析后的 ``MPServerConfig``。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:120
msgid "``coordinator_config``: parsed coordinator configuration."
msgstr "``coordinator_config``: 解析的协调器配置。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:121
msgid ""
"``modules``: built-in modules, plus modules returned by earlier plugin "
"factories in command-line order."
msgstr "``modules``: 内置模块，以及按命令行顺序返回的早期插件工厂的模块。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:123
msgid "``config``: the JSON object from this plugin's server-module spec."
msgstr "``config``: 此插件的服务器模块规范中的 JSON 对象。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:126
msgid "Module contract"
msgstr "模块契约"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:128
msgid "A returned module must expose the regular server module contract:"
msgstr "返回的模块必须暴露常规服务器模块契约："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:139
msgid ""
"Request handlers are ordinary transport-neutral handlers decorated with "
"``@request_handler``:"
msgstr "请求处理程序是普通的与传输无关的处理程序，使用 ``@request_handler`` 装饰："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:164
msgid ""
"Plugin modules can also expose extension protocol methods with "
"``@server_module_handler``:"
msgstr "插件模块还可以使用 ``@server_module_handler`` 暴露扩展协议方法："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:190
msgid ""
"Plugin modules are appended after built-in modules. If two modules "
"register the same existing request type, the later module wins for "
"transport handler registration. If two plugin modules register the same "
"``SERVER_MODULE_CALL`` method name, startup fails."
msgstr "插件模块会在内置模块之后附加。如果两个模块注册了相同的现有请求类型，则后注册的模块在传输处理程序注册中获胜。如果两个插件模块注册了相同的 ``SERVER_MODULE_CALL`` 方法名称，则启动失败。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:196
msgid "Transport-specific services"
msgstr "传输特定服务"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:198
msgid ""
"When an extension owns its protocol, return transport registrars in "
"``ExtServerModuleComponents``. LMCache calls the registrar that matches "
"the configured transport before the request server starts."
msgstr "当扩展拥有其协议时，在 ``ExtServerModuleComponents`` 中返回传输注册器。LMCache 在请求服务器启动之前调用与配置的传输匹配的注册器。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:202
msgid ""
"For gRPC, register generated services against the concrete "
"``grpc.Server``:"
msgstr "对于 gRPC，将生成的服务注册到具体的 ``grpc.Server``："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:215
msgid ""
"For ZMQ, register or start a package-owned ZMQ service against the "
"concrete ``MessageQueueServer``:"
msgstr "对于 ZMQ，注册或启动一个包拥有的 ZMQ 服务到具体的 ``MessageQueueServer``："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:227
msgid ""
"If a ZMQ registrar starts a sidecar socket, the plugin should also return"
" a module whose ``close()`` method stops that sidecar. Do not use "
"``register_zmq_services`` to add ``HandlerType.BLOCKING`` handlers to the"
" core ``MessageQueueServer`` unless the registrar also assigns an "
"executor with ``add_normal_thread_pool`` or ``add_affinity_thread_pool`` "
"before startup."
msgstr "如果 ZMQ 注册器启动了一个侧车套接字，则插件还应返回一个其 ``close()`` 方法可以停止该侧车的模块。除非注册器在启动之前还使用 ``add_normal_thread_pool`` 或 ``add_affinity_thread_pool`` 分配了一个执行器，否则不要使用 ``register_zmq_services`` 将 ``HandlerType.BLOCKING`` 处理程序添加到核心 ``MessageQueueServer``。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:233
msgid ""
"For compatibility with simple module-shaped plugins, LMCache also calls "
"``register_grpc_services(server)`` and ``register_zmq_services(server)`` "
"methods when a returned module exposes them. New packages should prefer "
"the explicit ``ExtServerModuleComponents`` fields so modules and "
"transport services stay separate."
msgstr "为了与简单的模块形状插件兼容，LMCache 还会在返回的模块公开时调用 ``register_grpc_services(server)`` 和 ``register_zmq_services(server)`` 方法。新包应优先使用显式的 ``ExtServerModuleComponents`` 字段，以便模块和传输服务保持分离。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:240
msgid "Envelope client calls"
msgstr "信封客户端调用"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:242
msgid "Both ZMQ and gRPC clients expose ``server_module_call``:"
msgstr "两个 ZMQ 和 gRPC 客户端都暴露了 ``server_module_call``："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:262
msgid "Liveness and cleanup"
msgstr "存活性和清理"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:264
msgid ""
"If a plugin owns per-worker state that should be pinged and reaped by "
"``ManagementModule``, implement the ``InstanceLivenessTarget`` method "
"set:"
msgstr "如果插件拥有每个工作进程的状态，并且该状态应该由 ``ManagementModule`` 进行 ping 和清理，请实现 ``InstanceLivenessTarget`` 方法集："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:267
msgid "``touch_instance(instance_id)``"
msgstr "``touch_instance(instance_id)``"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:268
msgid "``reap_stale_instances(reap_timeout_s, registration_grace_s)``"
msgstr "``reap_stale_instances(reap_timeout_s, registration_grace_s)``"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:269
msgid "``tracked_instance_count()``"
msgstr "``tracked_instance_count()``"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:270
msgid "``drop_instance_state(instance_id)``"
msgstr "``drop_instance_state(instance_id)``"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/server_modules.rst:272
msgid ""
"LMCache detects that method set when loading plugin modules and includes "
"the module in the management reaper targets."
msgstr "LMCache 在加载插件模块时检测到设置方法，并将该模块包含在管理收割者目标中。"

